OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for fatal stabbing
OL,4,Aafter row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who fatally stabbed another man
OL,7,Fafter an altercation outside his
OL,8,Fex-girlfriend's flat has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor 17 years.
OL,11,FJohn Robinson stabbed 30-year-old Mason
OL,12,FJones in the abdomen outside his on-off
OL,13,Fpartner's Burley in Wharfedale flat on
OL,14,F1 March. Jones later died in hospital.
OL,16,FRobinson, 30, was cleared of murder but
OL,17,Ffound guilty of manslaughter and
OL,18,Fpossession of a bladed article in a
OL,19,Fpublic place following a trial at
OL,20,FBradford Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
